# LLM Fine-Tuning for Forex Trading - Project Estimate

## Executive Summary
**Total Estimated Duration:** 16-20 weeks  
**Total Estimated Cost:** $180,000 - $280,000  
**Team Size:** 4-6 specialists  
**High-Risk Factors:** Model performance validation, regulatory compliance, real-time latency requirements

---

## Phase Breakdown

### Phase 1: Foundation & Data Pipeline (Weeks 1-4)
**Duration:** 4 weeks  
**Cost:** $40,000 - $60,000

#### Tasks:
- **Model Selection & Architecture Design** (1 week)
  - Evaluate base models (GPT-4, Claude, Llama 2/3, specialized financial models)
  - Design fine-tuning architecture
  - Set up development environment
  
- **Data Infrastructure** (2 weeks)
  - Historical EUR/USD 5-minute data acquisition (3-5 years)
  - Data cleaning and validation pipeline
  - Technical indicator calculation engine (MACD, RSI, Bollinger Bands, etc.)
  - Real-time data feed integration setup
  
- **Signal Definition Framework** (1 week)
  - Define entry/exit signal criteria
  - Create labeling system for training data
  - Develop backtesting framework

#### Resources:
- ML Engineer (Senior): 1 FTE
- Data Engineer: 1 FTE
- Forex Domain Expert: 0.5 FTE

#### Deliverables:
- Base model selection report
- Clean historical dataset (500K+ labeled examples)
- Technical indicator calculation system
- Data pipeline architecture

